### 1. prueba sin token (tiene que rebotar con 401 por passport)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos

### 2. crear un vehiculo nuevo
POST http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "marca": "Mercedes-Benz",
    "modelo": "Actros 2651",
    "patente": "AF123CD",
    "anio": 2023,
    "capacidad_carga": 28000.50
}

### 3. listar todos los vehiculos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. traer un vehiculo por id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. actualizar un vehiculo
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "marca": "Mercedes-Benz",
    "modelo": "Actros 2651 Full",
    "patente": "AF123CD",
    "anio": 2024,
    "capacidad_carga": 30000.00
}

### 6. eliminar un vehiculo
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}